1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,290
Man: Hey, Lisa, have you had a chance to visit that new cafe that just opened on 10th Street?

2
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:12,040
Woman: Not yet. I've heard mixed reviews.

3
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:16,160
Some say it's fantastic, others not so much. Have you been?

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,712
Man: Yes. And I was pleasantly surprised.

5
00:00:18,712 --> 00:00:24,180
The ambiance is cozy and their espresso is probably the best I've had in town.

6
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:27,340
The most disappointing part was their pastries, though

7
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,170
maybe it was too late in the day.

8
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:32,220
Woman: Even so, it does sound worth trying

9
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,260
I'll swing by this weekend after my basketball game.
